  "name": "Question 12",
  "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to  $\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061\\sqrt{u}?$",
  "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061x$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061x & =\\frac{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}{{e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2x}}{1+{e}^{-2x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the second definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061\\sqrt{u} & =\\frac{{e}^{2\\sqrt{u}}-1}{{e}^{2\\sqrt{u}}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
